  "estimatedMinutes": 25,
  "instructions": "## Nobody can reach the file server\n\nThe office has three PCs on a switch, a router R1, and a file server on `10.10.10.0/24` behind it. All three users say \"the server is down\", but the server itself is fine. There are **three separate faults**, one per PC.\n\n## Do this\n\nWork like a technician: ping the server from each PC, read the explanation, and fix only what is wrong. Check the cable, the address and mask, and the gateway, in that order (physical layer first).\n\nThe server and the router are correct; do not change them. Press **Check my network** when all three PCs reach the server.",
